<title>INDONESIA: Bank Bira says Q1 net at 20.4 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bank Bira says Q1 net at 20.4 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's Bank Bira said on Wednesday it posted net profit of 20.4 billion rupiah in the first quarter of 1997, a rise of 91 percent from the 10.7 billion rupiah profit posted in January-March 1996.</p>
<p>President Director Bambang Panutomo told shareholders at the annual general meeting that the rise was mainly due to a 33.5 percent increase in interest income, the bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
